  ('p-018','tiger-luxury-lipstick-set-gold','Tiger Luxury Matte Lipstick Set - 5 Shades','Tiger Beauty','Complete your lip wardrobe with the Tiger Luxury Matte Lipstick Set. Five curated shades take you from everyday nude to evening bold, all in a comfortable, long-wearing matte formula.

Enriched with shea butter and Vitamin E, these lipsticks glide on creamy and set to a non-drying matte finish that lasts up to 12 hours. The gold-tone casings are as beautiful as the shades inside.',ARRAY['5 curated nude-to-bold shades','Long-wearing matte finish, 12-hour','Enriched with shea butter and Vitamin E','Gold-tone bullet casings','Cruelty-free formula']::text[],'{"Finish":"Matte","Wear Time":"12 hours","Shades":"5 (nude, rose, red, berry, plum)","Cruelty-Free":"Yes","Net Weight":"3.5g each"}'::jsonb,4999,7499,40,ARRAY['https://images.pexels.com/photos/7256102/pexels-photo-7256102.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600','https://images.pexels.com/photos/26927323/pexels-photo-26927323.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600','https://images.pexels.com/photos/1470165/pexels-photo-1470165.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600','https://images.pexels.com/photos/12969358/pexels-photo-12969358.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600']::text[],ARRAY['']::text[],4.6,1456,ARRAY['bestseller','deal']::text[],true,'cat-makeup'),
  ('p-019','tiger-primer-grip-foundation-base','Tiger Power Grip Primer - Smoothing Base','Tiger Beauty','Create the perfect canvas for your makeup with the Tiger Power Grip Primer. This lightweight formula grips makeup for all-day wear while hyaluronic acid keeps skin hydrated and plump.

The smoothing effect blurs pores and fine lines instantly, creating a flawless base for foundation. A little goes a long way.',ARRAY['Smoothing grip primer','Hyaluronic acid infused','Extends makeup wear up to 12 hours','Blurs pores and fine lines','Suitable for all skin types']::text[],'{"Size":"30ml","Skin Type":"All types","Key Ingredient":"Hyaluronic Acid","Vegan":"Yes"}'::jsonb,1999,NULL,0,ARRAY['https://images.pexels.com/photos/30836145/pexels-photo-30836145.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600','https://images.pexels.com/photos/23940099/pexels-photo-23940099.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600','https://images.pexels.com/photos/13534508/pexels-photo-13534508.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600']::text[],ARRAY['']::text[],4.4,3210,ARRAY['out-of-stock']::text[],true,'cat-makeup'),
  ('p-020','tiger-adjustable-dumbbells-50lb','Tiger Adjustable Dumbbells 50lb Pair - Space Saving','Tiger Fitness','Transform your home gym with the Tiger Adjustable Dumbbells. Each dumbbell adjusts from 5 to 50 pounds in 2.5-pound increments with a simple turn of the dial, replacing 15 sets of traditional dumbbells.

The space-saving design stores neatly in the included tray, making it perfect for apartments and home gyms. The anti-roll safety design keeps your floors protected.',ARRAY['Replaces 15 sets of dumbbells','5 to 50 lbs per dumbbell, adjustable in 2.5 lb increments','Quick-select dial system','Compact storage tray included','Anti-roll safety design']::text[],'{"Weight Range":"5-50 lbs each","Increments":"2.5 lbs","Material":"Steel + contoured grip","Includes":"2 dumbbells + storage tray"}'::jsonb,29999,39999,14,ARRAY['https://images.pexels.com/photos/6740821/pexels-photo-6740821.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600','https://images.pexels.com/photos/4793221/pexels-photo-4793221.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600','https://images.pexels.com/photos/6293106/pexels-photo-6293106.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600','https://images.pexels.com/photos/20500863/pexels-photo-20500863.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600']::text[],ARRAY['https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dQw4w9WgXcQ']::text[],4.8,876,ARRAY['bestseller','premium']::text[],true,'cat-fitness-equipment'),
  ('p-021','tiger-yoga-mat-premium-6mm','Tiger Premium Yoga Mat 6mm - Non-Slip Extra Thick','Tiger Fitness','Practice in comfort with the Tiger Premium Yoga Mat. The 6mm thickness provides superior joint protection, while the double-sided non-slip surface keeps you stable in any pose.

Made from eco-friendly TPE material, this mat is free from latex, PVC, and toxic chemicals. The included carrying strap makes it easy to take to the studio.',ARRAY['6mm extra-thick cushioning','Double-sided non-slip surface','Eco-friendly TPE material','Includes carrying strap','Latex and PVC free']::text[],'{"Thickness":"6mm","Material":"Eco-friendly TPE","Size":"72\" x 26\"","Weight":"900g","Carrying Strap":"Included"}'::jsonb,4999,6999,75,ARRAY['https://images.pexels.com/photos/20500863/pexels-photo-20500863.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600','https://images.pexels.com/photos/8038694/pexels-photo-8038694.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600','https://images.pexels.com/photos/3931297/pexels-photo-3931297.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600']::text[],ARRAY['']::text[],4.6,4523,ARRAY['bestseller','deal']::text[],true,'cat-fitness-equipment'),
  ('p-022','tiger-hiking-backpack-40l','Tiger Hiking Backpack 40L - Waterproof','Tiger Outdoors','Tackle any trail with the Tiger Hiking Backpack. The 40-liter capacity holds everything you need for a day hike or overnight trip, while the airflow back system keeps you cool and comfortable.

The waterproof ripstop nylon and included rain cover protect your gear in any weather. Multiple compartments and a hydration bladder sleeve keep you organized on the trail.',ARRAY['40-liter capacity','Waterproof ripstop nylon','Adjustable airflow back system','Hydration bladder compatible','Rain cover included']::text[],'{"Capacity":"40 liters","Material":"Ripstop nylon","Weight":"1.2kg","Hydration Compatible":"Yes (bladder not included)","Rain Cover":"Included"}'::jsonb,8999,NULL,20,ARRAY['https://images.pexels.com/photos/4793221/pexels-photo-4793221.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600','https://images.pexels.com/photos/20500863/pexels-photo-20500863.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600']::text[],ARRAY['']::text[],4.7,678,ARRAY['new-arrival']::text[],true,'cat-outdoor-gear'),
  ('p-023','tiger-insulated-water-bottle-32oz','Tiger Insulated Water Bottle 32oz - Stainless Steel','Tiger Outdoors','Stay hydrated in style with the Tiger Insulated Water Bottle. The double-wall vacuum insulation keeps your drinks ice-cold for 24 hours or piping hot for 12 hours, making it perfect for any season.

Made from 18/8 food-grade stainless steel with a powder-coated finish, this bottle is as durable as it is beautiful. The leak-proof flip-top lid lets you drink one-handed.',ARRAY['Double-wall vacuum insulation','Keeps cold 24 hours, hot 12 hours','18/8 food-grade stainless steel','Leak-proof flip-top lid','Fits standard cup holders']::text[],'{"Capacity":"32oz","Material":"18/8 Stainless Steel","Cold Retention":"24 hours","Hot Retention":"12 hours","Lid":"Leak-proof flip-top"}'::jsonb,2999,3999,200,ARRAY['https://images.pexels.com/photos/6740821/pexels-photo-6740821.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600','https://images.pexels.com/photos/4793221/pexels-photo-4793221.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600']::text[],ARRAY['']::text[],4.8,8901,ARRAY['bestseller','deal']::text[],true,'cat-outdoor-gear'),
  ('p-024','tiger-strategy-board-game-deluxe','Tiger Strategy Board Game Deluxe Edition - Family Game Night','Tiger Games','Gather the family for game night with the Tiger Strategy Board Game Deluxe Edition. This award-winning strategy game combines resource management, negotiation, and tactical planning for endless replayability.

The deluxe edition features premium metal game pieces, a foil-stamped board, and an exclusive expansion pack. Perfect for game nights with friends and family.',ARRAY['For 2-6 players, ages 10+','60-90 minute play time','Premium metal game pieces','Foil-stamped game board','Includes expansion pack']::text[],'{"Players":"2-6","Age Range":"10+","Play Time":"60-90 minutes","Includes":"Board, pieces, cards, expansion"}'::jsonb,4999,6999,30,ARRAY['https://images.pexels.com/photos/9090534/pexels-photo-9090534.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600','https://images.pexels.com/photos/27403981/pexels-photo-27403981.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600','https://images.pexels.com/photos/278918/pexels-photo-278918.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600','https://images.pexels.com/photos/207924/pexels-photo-207924.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600']::text[],ARRAY['https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dQw4w9WgXcQ']::text[],4.9,1234,ARRAY['bestseller','deal']::text[],true,'cat-board-games'),
  ('p-025','tiger-family-card-game-collection','Tiger Family Card Game Collection - 5 Games in 1','Tiger Games','Five classic card games in one beautifully designed package. The Tiger Family Card Game Collection includes everything you need for hours of entertainment, from quick warm-up games to deep strategy sessions.

The premium linen-finish cards shuffle smoothly and hold up to countless game nights. The compact box is perfect for travel.',ARRAY['5 classic card games in one box','For 2-8 players, ages 8+','Premium linen-finish cards','Illustrated rulebook included','Compact travel size']::text[],'{"Players":"2-8","Age Range":"8+","Games Included":"5","Card Quality":"300gsm linen finish"}'::jsonb,2499,NULL,4,ARRAY['https://images.pexels.com/photos/31674909/pexels-photo-31674909.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600','https://images.pexels.com/photos/792051/pexels-photo-792051.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600','https://images.pexels.com/photos/1329644/pexels-photo-1329644.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600']::text[],ARRAY['']::text[],4.5,2100,ARRAY['low-stock']::text[],true,'cat-board-games'),
  ('p-026','tiger-1000-piece-puzzle-golden-tiger','Tiger 1000-Piece Puzzle - Golden Tiger Edition','Tiger Games','Piece together a masterpiece with the Tiger 1000-Piece Puzzle. The stunning golden tiger artwork comes to life as you assemble the premium blue-board pieces, each uniquely cut for a satisfying fit.

The included reference poster helps you along, and the finished puzzle is frame-worthy. A relaxing challenge for solo or group puzzling.',ARRAY['1000 pieces, premium blue board','Stunning golden tiger artwork','No two pieces alike - unique cut','Poster reference included','Finished size: 27" x 19"']::text[],'{"Pieces":"1000","Finished Size":"27\" x 19\"","Material":"Premium blue board","Includes":"Puzzle + reference poster"}'::jsonb,1999,2999,50,ARRAY['https://images.pexels.com/photos/207924/pexels-photo-207924.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600','https://images.pexels.com/photos/792051/pexels-photo-792051.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600','https://images.pexels.com/photos/209728/pexels-photo-209728.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600']::text[],ARRAY['']::text[],4.7,567,ARRAY['new-arrival','deal']::text[],true,'cat-puzzles'),
  ('p-027','tiger-fiction-bestseller-mystery-novel','The Midnight Trail - Award-Winning Mystery Novel','Tiger Press','A gripping mystery that keeps you turning pages late into the night. The Midnight Trail follows detective Sarah Chen as she unravels a decades-old disappearance in a small mountain town.

With its richly drawn characters and twist-filled plot, this award-winning novel has captivated millions of readers. The perfect gift for mystery lovers.',ARRAY['Hardcover, 384 pages','New York Times Bestseller','Award-winning author','Book club discussion guide included']::text[],'{"Format":"Hardcover","Pages":"384","Publisher":"Tiger Press","Language":"English","ISBN":"978-0-XXXXXXX-1"}'::jsonb,1899,2499,100,ARRAY['https://images.pexels.com/photos/8762862/pexels-photo-8762862.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600','https://images.pexels.com/photos/1132577/pexels-photo-1132577.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600','https://images.pexels.com/photos/8200898/pexels-photo-8200898.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600']::text[],ARRAY['']::text[],4.8,5432,ARRAY['bestseller','deal']::text[],true,'cat-fiction'),
  ('p-028','tiger-scifi-epic-hardcover','Stars Beyond the Veil - Epic Sci-Fi Hardcover','Tiger Press','Journey across the galaxy in this epic science fiction saga. Stars Beyond the Veil introduces a cast of unforgettable characters navigating interstellar politics, ancient mysteries, and the thin line between survival and annihilation.

The first book in the acclaimed Veil Saga trilogy, this Hugo-nominated novel combines hard science fiction with deeply human storytelling.',ARRAY['Hardcover, 624 pages','Book 1 of the Veil Saga trilogy','Hugo Award nominee','Includes illustrated character guide']::text[],'{"Format":"Hardcover","Pages":"624","Publisher":"Tiger Press","Language":"English","ISBN":"978-0-XXXXXXX-2"}'::jsonb,2799,NULL,35,ARRAY['https://images.pexels.com/photos/1132577/pexels-photo-1132577.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600','https://images.pexels.com/photos/8762862/pexels-photo-8762862.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600','https://images.pexels.com/photos/1693959/pexels-photo-1693959.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600']::text[],ARRAY['']::text[],4.7,2100,ARRAY['new-arrival']::text[],true,'cat-fiction'),
  ('p-029','tiger-productivity-guide-hardcover','The Golden Hour - Master Your Productivity','Tiger Press','Transform how you work with The Golden Hour. This practical guide distills decades of productivity research into actionable frameworks you can apply today. Stop chasing hacks and start mastering your time.

Each chapter includes exercises and templates that help you build sustainable habits. The included downloadable workbook keeps you on track long after you finish reading.',ARRAY['Hardcover, 288 pages','Practical frameworks and exercises','Wallstreet Journal Bestseller','Includes downloadable workbook']::text[],'{"Format":"Hardcover","Pages":"288","Publisher":"Tiger Press","Language":"English","ISBN":"978-0-XXXXXXX-3"}'::jsonb,2299,2999,60,ARRAY['https://images.pexels.com/photos/1693959/pexels-photo-1693959.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600','https://images.pexels.com/photos/8460337/pexels-photo-8460337.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600','https://images.pexels.com/photos/17548877/pexels-photo-17548877.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600']::text[],ARRAY['']::text[],4.6,3200,ARRAY['bestseller','deal']::text[],true,'cat-non-fiction'),
  ('p-030','tiger-cookbook-golden-kitchen','The Golden Kitchen - 100 Recipes from Around the World','Tiger Press','Elevate your home cooking with The Golden Kitchen. Award-winning chef Marcus Lin shares 100 of his favorite recipes from around the world, each adapted for the home cook with accessible ingredients and clear instructions.

Every recipe is accompanied by a stunning full-color photograph, helpful tips, and a pantry guide that makes stocking your kitchen effortless. A must-have for food lovers.',ARRAY['Hardcover, 320 pages','100 curated recipes with full-color photos','Includes pantry guide and substitutions','Award-winning chef author']::text[],'{"Format":"Hardcover","Pages":"320","Publisher":"Tiger Press","Language":"English","ISBN":"978-0-XXXXXXX-4"}'::jsonb,3499,NULL,25,ARRAY['https://images.pexels.com/photos/1693959/pexels-photo-1693959.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600','https://images.pexels.com/photos/14924122/pexels-photo-14924122.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600','https://images.pexels.com/photos/1098656/pexels-photo-1098656.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600']::text[],ARRAY['https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dQw4w9WgXcQ']::text[],4.9,1876,ARRAY['bestseller','new-arrival']::text[],true,'cat-non-fiction'),
  ('p-031','tiger-pro-tool-set-200-piece','Tiger Pro Mechanic Tool Set - 200 Piece','Tiger Auto','Tackle any automotive repair with the Tiger Pro Mechanic Tool Set. This 200-piece collection includes everything from ratchets and sockets to wrenches and screwdrivers, all forged from durable chrome vanadium steel.

The organized blow-molded case keeps every tool in its place with clearly labeled compartments. Backed by a lifetime replacement guarantee.',ARRAY['200-piece comprehensive set','Chrome vanadium steel construction','Includes ratchets, sockets, wrenches, and more','Blow-molded case with labeled compartments','Lifetime replacement guarantee']::text[],'{"Piece Count":"200","Material":"Chrome vanadium steel","Drive Sizes":"1/4\", 3/8\", 1/2\"","Case":"Blow-molded","Warranty":"Lifetime"}'::jsonb,19999,25999,16,ARRAY['https://images.pexels.com/photos/10126655/pexels-photo-10126655.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600','https://images.pexels.com/photos/36597205/pexels-photo-36597205.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600','https://images.pexels.com/photos/4480451/pexels-photo-4480451.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600','https://images.pexels.com/photos/29181493/pexels-photo-29181493.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600']::text[],ARRAY['https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dQw4w9WgXcQ']::text[],4.8,743,ARRAY['bestseller','premium','deal']::text[],true,'cat-car-tools'),
  ('p-032','tiger-odb2-scanner-professional','Tiger OBD2 Scanner Professional - Bluetooth Diagnostic Tool','Tiger Auto','Diagnose car problems like a pro with the Tiger OBD2 Scanner. This compact Bluetooth device plugs into your vehicle OBD2 port and connects to your phone, giving you access to the same diagnostic information as a professional mechanic.

Read and clear check engine codes, stream live data, and graph sensor readings in real time. The free app includes a database of over 10,000 code definitions.',ARRAY['Bluetooth connectivity to iOS and Android','Reads and clears all OBD2 codes','Live data streaming and graphing','Compatible with all vehicles 1996+','Free app with lifetime updates']::text[],'{"Connectivity":"Bluetooth 4.0","Compatibility":"All OBD2 vehicles (1996+)","App":"iOS + Android, free","Code Database":"10,000+ definitions","Dimensions":"48 x 35 x 20mm"}'::jsonb,8999,NULL,42,ARRAY['https://images.pexels.com/photos/4116191/pexels-photo-4116191.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600','https://images.pexels.com/photos/10126655/pexels-photo-10126655.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600','https://images.pexels.com/photos/8556051/pexels-photo-8556051.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600']::text[],ARRAY['']::text[],4.6,1567,ARRAY['new-arrival']::text[],true,'cat-car-tools'),
  ('p-033','tiger-car-vacuum-cordless','Tiger Cordless Car Vacuum - High Power handheld','Tiger Auto','Keep your car spotless with the Tiger Cordless Car Vacuum. The powerful 120W motor tackles dirt, pet hair, and crumbs with ease, while the HEPA filter ensures clean exhaust air.

The cordless, USB-C rechargeable design means you are never tethered to an outlet. Three nozzle attachments help you reach every crevice. 30 minutes of runtime handles even the messiest vehicles.',ARRAY['Cordless, USB-C rechargeable','120W high-suction motor','HEPA filter captures 99.9% of particles','Includes 3 nozzle attachments','30-minute runtime per charge']::text[],'{"Power":"120W","Runtime":"30 minutes","Charging":"USB-C","Filter":"HEPA (washable)","Weight":"650g"}'::jsonb,5999,7999,55,ARRAY['https://images.pexels.com/photos/4488639/pexels-photo-4488639.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600','https://images.pexels.com/photos/4489749/pexels-photo-4489749.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600','https://images.pexels.com/photos/4480451/pexels-photo-4480451.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600']::text[],ARRAY['']::text[],4.5,2890,ARRAY['bestseller','deal']::text[],true,'cat-car-accessories'),
  ('p-034','tiger-car-phone-mount-magnetic','Tiger Magnetic Car Phone Mount - 360 Rotation','Tiger Auto','Keep your phone secure and visible on every drive with the Tiger Magnetic Car Phone Mount. Six powerful neodymium magnets hold your phone firmly in place, even on bumpy roads.

The 360-degree rotation ball joint lets you find the perfect viewing angle. Includes both a vent clip and dashboard adhesive mount for ultimate flexibility.',ARRAY['Strong neodymium magnets','360-degree rotation ball joint','Vent clip and dashboard adhesive options','Compatible with all phone sizes','One-hand mount and release']::text[],'{"Mount Type":"Vent clip + dashboard adhesive","Magnets":"6 neodymium","Rotation":"360 degrees","Compatibility":"All phone sizes"}'::jsonb,1999,NULL,0,ARRAY['https://images.pexels.com/photos/4489721/pexels-photo-4489721.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600','https://images.pexels.com/photos/4116232/pexels-photo-4116232.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600']::text[],ARRAY['']::text[],4.4,4567,ARRAY['out-of-stock','deal']::text[],true,'cat-car-accessories')
